! version = 2.0

// =============================================================================
//  Abdisamad E. Yusuf — Resume Assistant brain (RiveScript)
//  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  This is the ONLY file you need to edit to change what the chatbot knows.
//  No database, no AI, no API keys. Every answer below is predefined.
//
//  HOW TO EDIT
//    + trigger here          <- what the visitor types (lowercase, no punctuation)
//    - Bot reply here        <- what the bot answers
//    ^ more reply text       <- continues the previous line
//
//  RULES OF THUMB
//    *                    matches exactly one word
//    #                    matches one or more words (captured as a number)
//    _                    matches one or more words (ignored)
//    [a|b|c]              optional alternatives
//    (a|b)                required alternatives
//    {weight=20}          priority — written inside the trigger line
//
//  THREE THINGS THAT WILL BITE YOU
//
//    1. Two `+` lines in a row are read as ALTERNATIVES SHARING ONE REPLY
//       BLOCK, so the first one ends up with no reply at all. Always put
//       alternatives inside ONE line with `|`:
//
//         + [*] (hello|hi|hey) [*]
//         - Hi there.
//
//    2. The weight tag is `{weight=20}` — curly braces, inside the trigger.
//
//    3. RiveScript tests triggers by how many wildcards they contain, and the
//       FIRST match wins. A broad rule like `[*] experience [*]` would shadow
//       a narrow one like `[*] linux experience [*]`, so narrow rules carry
//       `{weight=20}` and broad catch-alls `{weight=1}`. Higher weight is
//       tested first. If you add a rule and it never fires, give it a weight.
//
//  SAFETY
//    Anything not covered here falls through to the FALLBACK section at the
//    bottom. The bot is never allowed to invent a fact.
//
//  OPEN TODO ITEMS
//    Search this file for "TODO". Those are the only questions Abdisamad has
//    not answered yet (salary, notice period, relocation, weaknesses, GPA,
//    GuardAura, Sameelo). Each one replies honestly that the information is
//    not in the profile.
// =============================================================================


